uster accepts an unsupported scheduler version and authors its own duplicate-name message, and UpdateCluster is unimplemented"},{"f":"20261029T204746Z-pcs-the-aws-published-public-ssm-parameter-namespace-aws.md","st":"f","sev":"H","ck":"behavioral","t":"The AWS-published public SSM parameter namespace /aws/service/pcs is empty, so the PCS-recommended AMI id can never be resolved and no compute-node-group workflow can be built"},{"f":"20261029T190856Z-pcs-5-net-new-root-causes-cluster-queue.md","st":"o","sev":"H","ck":"wire","t":"pcs: 5 net-new root causes \u2014 cluster, queue and node-group error paths serve the wrong HTTP status, the wrong error class and emulator-authored messages, and CreateCluster never validates subnets"},{"f":"20261023T123102Z-ssm-getparametersbypath-stub.md","st":"f","sev":"H","ck":"behavioral","t":"Implement ssm GetParametersByPath: unimplemented scaffold stub"},{"f":"20261023T123102Z-pcs-fidelity-bundle-5-divergences-not-found-message.md","st":"f","sev":"H","ck":"behavioral","t":"PCS fidelity bundle: 5 divergences \u2014 not-found message text, ValidationException message format, CreateComputeNodeGroup validation ordering, and 4 unimplemented tagging/bootstrap operations"}]}